# setuptools_scm's file finder offers every git-tracked file to the sdist,
# which would otherwise ship docs/plans/. Those plans are working history --
# why the code is shaped the way it is -- and they stay in git for whoever
# asks that question, but nobody who installs a release needs them. prune
# names the directory rather than today's files, so the next plan and its
# audit notes are excluded too.
prune docs/plans
